E1: --probe-unnamed-defs (prereg v4 block Q)

make_probes(unnamed_defs=True) leaves out the appended " Definition in
effect: <statement>" of definition-item probes and keeps the question;
probe ids, gold and dependencies are unchanged. The E1 driver threads the
flag to the pre- and post-shift probes of every cell (the hash assertion
still holds) and records probe_unnamed_defs in the manifest params.
Default unchanged.

